Related work
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The design loop's code emitter is the Bioinspired3D LoRA adapter
(rachelkluu/Bioinspired3D on Hugging Face), and the loop's emit, render,
critique and repair design follows the Bioinspired123D system it was released
with: R. K. Luu and M. J. Buehler, "Bioinspired123D: generative 3D modeling
system for bioinspired structures", AI for Science 2, 025004 (2026),
doi:10.1088/3050-287X/ae61d1; code at https://github.com/lamm-mit/Bioinspired123D
(Apache-2.0). No code from that repository is included here.

Model weights used at run time (the Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct base model, the
Bioinspired3D LoRA adapter, a sentence-embedding model, and local Ollama
models) are NOT distributed with this software; they are downloaded by the
user and remain subject to their own licenses.

